{
  "schema_version": "oci_benchmark_registry_v1",
  "description": "Benchmark scenarios for scripts/benchmark.py. S0 is the baseline; S1-S6 isolate single factor families; S7-S12b add null-HTE, epistatic/interacting HTE, multi-way subgroups with rare rates, out-of-family non-parametric (RFF + rational) surfaces, combined EHR stress, and variable/high-dimensional (5 to 50 confounders and 5 to 50 modifiers) complex DGPs. See docs/benchmarks.md.",
  "scenarios": [
